          "text": "The comparison must match all values."
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "It sorts every value."
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "The comparison can match any value from the subquery result."
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "It replaces NULL values."
